# Mechanic: optional trigger payment retains the exact ability source.
# Four eligible creatures prevent automatic selection of the whole domain.
# Kitt supplies the trigger; Bears is a legal active-player target.
# Corpse and Merfolk allow choosing two helpers while leaving others untapped.
# No opposing hand or permanents adds an unrelated choice.
# Browser assertions own payment, target, effect and continuation outcomes.
